<title>USA: NationsBank eyes Aames -- report.</title>
<headline>NationsBank eyes Aames -- report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp has been interested in acquiring a subprime lender and has looked at the books of Aames Financial Corp, American Banker said Thursday.</p>
<p>The publication cited investment bankers as the source of the report but did not identify them.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for NationsBank told Reuters the company does not comment on rumors or speculation. Aames officials could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>NationsBank was up 1/2 to 68-1/4 in early trading. Aames was up 1/8 to 18-5/8.</p>
</text>
